      "target_agent": "SceneDesignerAgent"
    },
    {
      "issue": "The stone_axe crafting recipe (3 cobblestone + 2 sticks in a specific 3x3 pattern) requires Minecraft-specific knowledge. A general-purpose AI agent must know the exact grid placement: cobblestone in slots [0,1], [1,0], [1,1] and sticks in [2,0], [2,1] (or mirrored). This is non-trivial domain knowledge but is inherent to any 'craft' task and cannot be avoided.",
