      "target_agent": "TaskSelectorAgent"
    },
    {
      "issue": "The player must know to equip and use the wooden pickaxe to mine the stone slab (bare-hand mining of stone slabs drops nothing). This is basic Minecraft knowledge but could trip up a non-expert agent.",
      "severity": "low",
      "target_agent": "both"
    },
    {
      "issue": "Milestone rules are sound. inventory_has(stone_slab, 1) correctly detects mining since the player starts with 0 stone_slabs, and inventory_has(stone_axe, 1) correctly detects crafting since no stone_axe exists at start. Verified via inventory screenshot — clean starting state confirmed.",
